# LF everywhere, in the repository and in the work tree. .editorconfig asks for LF and CI checks it
# with dotnet format on a Windows runner, where native endings would be CRLF and fail every build.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.cs text diff=csharp
*.csproj text
*.slnx text
*.props text
*.json text
*.md text
*.xaml text
*.yml text

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
